Template: tacacsrs-bash-plugin/enable-bash-plugin
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Add tacacsrs-bash-plugin to /etc/bash_plugins.conf?
 If the value is true, the package adds a managed plugin entry for
 /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/security/tacacsrs_bash_plugin.so to
 /etc/bash_plugins.conf.
 .
 A false value removes only the package-managed block. Other content in the
 configuration file remains unchanged. You can run dpkg-reconfigure
 tacacsrs-bash-plugin later to change the value.